{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01728",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 7.48,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "yeah, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.25,
      "end_seconds": 12.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.18,
      "end_seconds": 19.95,
      "duration_seconds": 6.77,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a barking cough, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.72,
      "end_seconds": 23.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.23,
      "end_seconds": 26.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Nothing regular, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.32,
      "end_seconds": 33.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.31,
      "end_seconds": 37.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "probably about four days. Yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.14,
      "end_seconds": 50.68,
      "duration_seconds": 9.54,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.79,
      "end_seconds": 64.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.83,
      "text": "I'd say on and off. I'd give it a seven, um, out of ten. I've also had a runny nose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.85,
      "end_seconds": 69.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "What about a hoarse voice, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.9,
      "end_seconds": 74.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Yes, for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.54,
      "end_seconds": 79.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "And what about difficulty swallowing, noisy breathing when resting or drooling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.63,
      "end_seconds": 89.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Hmm, no difficulty swallowing, noisy breathing when resting or drooling, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.12,
      "end_seconds": 93.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right, have you had any blue lips?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.18,
      "end_seconds": 96.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "No blue lips, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.19,
      "end_seconds": 99.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.33,
      "end_seconds": 103.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.76,
      "end_seconds": 109.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "Okay, how about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.86,
      "end_seconds": 116.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so no, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.88,
      "end_seconds": 119.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 120.65,
      "end_seconds": 123.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "No, you know, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.78,
      "end_seconds": 127.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Has anyone in your family had anything serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.8,
      "end_seconds": 131.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "my daughter has type 1 diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.8,
      "end_seconds": 149.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.4,
      "end_seconds": 171.31,
      "duration_seconds": 20.91,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions. I quit smoking around ten years ago. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. My partner and our baby"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.7,
      "end_seconds": 179.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.36,
      "end_seconds": 184.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "yes, tramadol i get feeling very drowsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.59,
      "end_seconds": 190.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.18,
      "end_seconds": 193.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "I've, I've got COPD."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.84,
      "end_seconds": 199.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Sure. Okay, I can see COPD in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.16,
      "end_seconds": 212.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "time for your numbers, if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.42,
      "end_seconds": 222.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.46,
      "end_seconds": 243.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.3,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, pulse 85, pressure 120 over 74. And respiratory rate 16, temperature 36.5."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.76,
      "end_seconds": 247.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.75,
      "end_seconds": 251.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.38,
      "end_seconds": 256.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.37,
      "end_seconds": 259.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.87,
      "end_seconds": 279.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.65,
      "text": "he is playful, breathing comfortably at rest, and I can't hear any noisy breathing now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.02,
      "end_seconds": 295.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Having listened and examined, I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at mild croup or a viral cold."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.65,
      "end_seconds": 338.35,
      "duration_seconds": 28.7,
      "text": "let's use dexamethasone, 0.15 mg per kg, once, single dose. You take it by mouth. It's for croup. It's a commonly used medicine and most people tolerate it well. Keep him calm, sit him upright, and give fluids. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.04,
      "end_seconds": 349.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "One warning sign to remember: he makes a noisy sound when resting or struggles to breathe. In that case don't wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 351.11,
      "end_seconds": 355.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Ah, yes, I'll bear that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 356.31,
      "end_seconds": 360.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "I'll want another look if no better in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.81,
      "end_seconds": 362.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.36,
      "end_seconds": 370.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.92,
      "end_seconds": 375.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "thank you, that's helpful"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 375.8,
      "end_seconds": 377.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Goodbye for now."
    }
  ]
}